e; repeated FS was negative. A false negative FS can be seen if tap water, which contains chloride, is used on the slide. Possibly an extraneous protein in the spinal fluid acted as inhibitor. Hence, if there is a high clinical suspicion of TB, FS should not be the only screening test done on a sample.
